      "id": 2875,
      "hub_id": null,
      "guid": "com.wtt.cag",
      "name": "WTT - Clothing and Gear [BETA]",
      "slug": "wtt-clothing-and-gear-beta",
      "teaser": "lousy smarch weather...",
      "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/LJvIPCaFylDVXM7wY0HVsAa2EDPS4AQ6rFDj72rz.png",
      "downloads": 702,
      "favourites_count": 28,
      "description": "<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">What is CAG?</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>THIS VERSION OF CAG IS A PRE-RELEASE, EXPECT SOME BUGS.</strong></p>\n\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/Z6vsyNQI.png\" alt=\"Image\" /></p>\n<p>WTT-Clothing and Gear (CAG) is the WTT-Armory equivalent for clothing mods, adding new high-quality Clothing, Armor, and Headgear to the game, all of which is friendly to the style of the Game’s existing assets.</p>\n\n<p>(Mostly) Everything in this mod is added to the <strong>CAG Specific Trader, Hoser,</strong> who only sells items from this mod, and nothing else.</p>\n<p>He does not have any quests, for now.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">The Wiki</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>As a side-project, I have (mostly singlehandedly, sorry noodal) been working on a comprehensive Wiki Page for WTT projects. THIS IS UNFINISHED, BUT HAS A LOT OF EXISTING DATA.</strong></p>\n<p>You can find it here:\n<a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://welcometotarkov.wiki.gg/wiki/Clothing_and_Gear_(CAG)\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://welcometotarkov.wiki.gg/wiki/Clothing_and_Gear_(CAG)</a></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Gallery</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/hZr4Sa9I.png\" alt=\"Image\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/EB1t9hvw.png\" alt=\"Image\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/KXyQaCCT.png\" alt=\"Gallery 1\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/w5fIEygS.png\" alt=\"Gallery 1\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/djMwEEtE.png\" alt=\"Image\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/7CFcT6E2.png\" alt=\"Render\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/YhCUnvg6.png\" alt=\"Render\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/SNcIV9pI.png\" alt=\"Render\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/16PeVzoD.png\" alt=\"Render\" />\n<strong>UNRELEASED ITEMS, COMING SOON</strong>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/R7QeXfoZ.png\" alt=\"Render\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/MV1XLD5H.png\" alt=\"Render\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">The Team</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>Dar’Zhar</strong> | Assets &amp; QA</p>\n<p><strong>Eco</strong> | Asset Fixing and QA</p>\n<p><strong>Eukyre (Myself)</strong> | Almost all Assets and Balancing</p>\n<p><strong>GrooveyPenguinX</strong> | Codebase &amp; QA</p>\n<p><strong>Rwby</strong> | Assorts</p>\n<p><strong>Tron</strong> | Assorts &amp; (some) Assets</p>\n<p><strong>Pein</strong> | he had the “what is wtt?” copypasta i needed</p>\n<p><strong>Pigeon</strong> | diamond 1 procrastinator</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-5\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">What is WTT?</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><strong>What is Welcome To Thursday ?</strong></p>\n<p>Welcome To Thursday (WTT) is a mod for SPT AKI that has been in development for over a year. What started as a small passion project has grown in size to incorporate 15+ core members as well as contributions from other well-known mod authors and friends of WTT alike.</p>\n<p><strong>How does Welcome To Thursday change the game?</strong></p>\n<p>As a mod, WTT overhauls SPT, touching on almost every vanilla game system, as well as adding completely new systems to the game and its core mechanics. Inspired by open-world hardcore survival projects like STALKER: Anomaly and STALKER: GAMMA, WTT takes SPT’s artificial multiplayer MMO difficulty adders and replaces them with a challenging world economy, loot scarcity rebalancing, a lore friendly quest overhaul, and a map-traveling system built from rewritten portions of the Traveler mod allowing seamless travel between maps. Aside from its changes to the game’s core properties, WTT also adds to the world’s variety of traders, NPC’s, characters, items, and quests:</p>\n<p>Over 1,000 custom bundles adding new weapons, attachments, wearables, containers, food, medical, and barter items.\nNew bosses with their own custom gear that will be properly incorporated into WTT’s quest lines.\nNew, meaningful traders with their own lore-friendly quests and narrative elements to help the player progress through the story-line of WTT.\nNew playable characters and outfits that will add to the player’s customization abilities.\nNew quest types incorporating brand new map extraction points, putting the player’s knowledge and familiarization of SPT’s maps to the test.\nWelcome To Thursday stands as one of the largest mods created for SPT thus far.</p>\n<p><strong>When does Welcome To Thursday release?</strong></p>\n<p>Take a guess from the name.</p>\n<p><strong>Which Thursday?</strong></p>\n<p>TBD</p>\n<p><strong>Want to follow our progress?</strong></p>\n<p>You can follow the project through it’s development in our discord here:</p>\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://discord.gg/Nz6VX78xRa\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://discord.gg/Nz6VX78xRa</a></p></div></div></div>\n",
