          "version": "0.1.3",
          "description": "## v0.1.3 for SPT 4.0.X\nThanks again to everybody who reported bugs to us during this process, your insight is absolutely crucial to helping us make this mod perfect! <3\n### New Content\n- UNTAR high cut helmet (Works for quests!)\n- Zero Foxtrot Woobie Hoodie (available Hoser LL3)\n- Spiritus Systems LV-120 (Olive Drab)\n- Platatac Bullock Echo bag (M81 & Coyote)\n### Bug Fixes\n- Fixed a naming inconsistency that caused NREs on Linux\n- Added ConflictingItems to headsets to prevent double-stacking\n- Fixed REV-X headset using a placeholder description\n- Changed RootNamespace to better match the project\n- Fixed an error that was causing the AM95 to have level 1 armor\n- Fixed a bug that was causing FIKA users to be unable to extract from a raid\n- Fixed a bug with the PICO-DS plate carrier that allowed any item to go into medical slots\n- Fixed Crye AirFrame (Black) having no soft armor inserts.\n- Bumped the mod's load order to be above Backport for renaming purposes\n- Fixed the DTNVS not being available on the Wilcox L4G24 mounts\n- Fixed Assort bugs and tweaked values\n### Gallery\n![Image](https://imgup.uk/i/djMwEEtE.png)\n![Image](https://imgup.uk/i/rSnk3cP7.png)",
