      "description": "<h2>v0.1.3 for SPT 4.0.X</h2>\n<p>Thanks again to everybody who reported bugs to us during this process, your insight is absolutely crucial to helping us make this mod perfect! &lt;3</p>\n<h3>New Content</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>UNTAR high cut helmet (Works for quests!)</li>\n<li>Zero Foxtrot Woobie Hoodie (available Hoser LL3)</li>\n<li>Spiritus Systems LV-120 (Olive Drab)</li>\n<li>Platatac Bullock Echo bag (M81 &amp; Coyote)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed a naming inconsistency that caused NREs on Linux</li>\n<li>Added ConflictingItems to headsets to prevent double-stacking</li>\n<li>Fixed REV-X headset using a placeholder description</li>\n<li>Changed RootNamespace to better match the project</li>\n<li>Fixed an error that was causing the AM95 to have level 1 armor</li>\n<li>Fixed a bug that was causing FIKA users to be unable to extract from a raid</li>\n<li>Fixed a bug with the PICO-DS plate carrier that allowed any item to go into medical slots</li>\n<li>Fixed Crye AirFrame (Black) having no soft armor inserts.</li>\n<li>Bumped the mod’s load order to be above Backport for renaming purposes</li>\n<li>Fixed the DTNVS not being available on the Wilcox L4G24 mounts</li>\n<li>Fixed Assort bugs and tweaked values</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Gallery</h3>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/djMwEEtE.png\" alt=\"Image\" />\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://imgup.uk/i/rSnk3cP7.png\" alt=\"Image\" /></p>\n",
